WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:18.345
Rat brushed at the snow.

2
00:00:18.346 --> 00:00:22.267
He cleared away an area of painted wood.

3
00:00:22.268 --> 00:00:25.407
"What is it?" said Mole, excited.

4
00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:28.064
"Never mind," said Rat.

5
00:00:28.065 --> 00:00:31.014
"Now we must really dig."

6
00:00:31.015 --> 00:00:37.587
They scraped and dug and pushed away the snow.

7
00:00:37.588 --> 00:00:41.831
At last the entire piece of wood was cleared.

8
00:00:41.832 --> 00:00:45.957
In the moonlight, Mole saw what it was.

9
00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:50.472
"Why, it's a little door!" cried Mole.

10
00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:54.807
An iron bell hung beside the door.

11
00:00:54.808 --> 00:00:58.411
"Read this, Mole," said Rat, pointing.

12
00:00:58.412 --> 00:01:05.948
A name was carved in the center of the door: MR. BADGER.

13
00:01:05.949 --> 00:01:09.408
Mole fell backward in the snow.

14
00:01:09.409 --> 00:01:12.491
"Rat!" he cried with surprise.

15
00:01:12.492 --> 00:01:15.612
"It's Mr. Badger's house!

16
00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:19.714
You have a very clever brain, Ratty!"

17
00:01:19.715 --> 00:01:23.682
"How did you figure it out?" asked Mole.

18
00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:27.227
"Are you going to talk all night?" said Rat.

19
00:01:27.228 --> 00:01:29.820
"Ring that bell!"

20
00:01:29.821 --> 00:01:32.820
Mole grabbed the bell rope.

21
00:01:32.821 --> 00:01:37.877
He pulled so hard his feet left the ground.

22
00:01:37.878 --> 00:01:42.026
Rat beat the door with his club.

23
00:01:42.027 --> 00:01:46.603
"I hope he comes soon!" cried Mole.

24
00:01:46.604 --> 00:01:48.422
They waited.

25
00:01:48.423 --> 00:01:51.844
They stamped their feet to keep warm.

26
00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:58.020
At last Rat said, "I think I hear footsteps."

27
00:01:58.021 --> 00:02:02.751
They heard someone unlock the door.

28
00:02:02.752 --> 00:02:06.608
The door opened a few inches.

29
00:02:06.609 --> 00:02:10.232
A long nose poked out.

30
00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:15.641
Two sleepy eyes stared at them.
